    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess, but without the bureaucratic back-and-forth of <i>actually taking your turns</i>. There's no time to waste in this hectic re-imagining of your favorite checkered strategy game. Blink once, and it's Checkmate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.poster.avif?t=1754504045\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.webm?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.mp4?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every time you move a piece, you lose some mana- But every second, you gain some mana. Save it up to launch a 4-pronged assault, or move one piece at a time to keep your enemy on their toes! Both players move simultaneously, so quick-witted maneuvers are just as important as long-term strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.poster.avif?t=1754504045\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.webm?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.mp4?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single match can last anywhere between 10 seconds and 10 minutes. Hyper Chess features over a dozen unique Chess Sets to collect, several unique game modes to spice up the fun, and local/online multiplayer.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess, but without the bureaucratic back-and-forth of <i>actually taking your turns</i>. There's no time to waste in this hectic re-imagining of your favorite checkered strategy game. Blink once, and it's Checkmate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.poster.avif?t=1754504045\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.webm?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.mp4?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every time you move a piece, you lose some mana- But every second, you gain some mana. Save it up to launch a 4-pronged assault, or move one piece at a time to keep your enemy on their toes! Both players move simultaneously, so quick-witted maneuvers are just as important as long-term strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.poster.avif?t=1754504045\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.webm?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.mp4?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single match can last anywhere between 10 seconds and 10 minutes. Hyper Chess features over a dozen unique Chess Sets to collect, several unique game modes to spice up the fun, and local/online multiplayer.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "There are NO TURNS in this wild version of Chess! Pieces move across the board in real-time, so you'll need to think fast to protect your King!",
